d kiya question. Sitter for KP.", "role": "confirmation", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-31T09:09:59Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "But was not able to differentiate between colors etc. it shows in his latter paintings", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-31T09:10:52Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "His color boundaries became quite diffused, plus a few colors didn’t match the schemes he would be painting", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-31T09:21:43Z", "username": "Abhishek S", "text": "He destroyed a lot of these after cataract surgery, right?", "role": "confirmation", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-31T09:26:56Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "He basically never really recovered fully", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-31T09:27:18Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "I think he did try to correct some of these paintings, but the effort was also unsuccessful", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-31T09:28:44Z", "username": "Abhishek S", "text": "Main Art category hi hata raha hoo Semi final se", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-31T09:29:47Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "Abbe yaaar", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-31T10:46:29Z", "username": "Saara", "text": "Billy jowl?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-10-31T10:50:44Z", "username": "Abhishek S", "text": "Change the speech bubble to say \"She'll Owlways be a woman to me\" and this is perfect!", "role": "confirmation", "is_correct": null, "h